1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,811
Before our school trip, Mira showed me a picture of Earth.

2
00:00:03,761 --> 00:00:11,125
The atmosphere is the air around us; the hydrosphere includes all water; the lithosphere is Earth’s hard outer layer,’ she said.

3
00:00:11,125 --> 00:00:13,829
Below the crust lay the mantle and core.

4
00:00:13,829 --> 00:00:21,045
We learned that water contains hydrogen and oxygen, and that carbon dioxide helps keep Earth warm through the greenhouse effect.

5
00:00:21,045 --> 00:00:24,193
Then we checked our map’s longitude and latitude.

6
00:00:24,193 --> 00:00:26,681
Our camp was at a high altitude.

7
00:00:26,681 --> 00:00:29,318
I looked toward the horizon and smiled.

8
00:00:29,318 --> 00:00:33,397
Today, the words in my notebook would become part of a real adventure.

